name musical
category Package
revision 54758
shortdesc Typeset (musical) theatre scripts
longdesc This package is designed to simplify the development and
longdesc distribution of scripts for theatrical musicals, especially
longdesc ones under development. The output is formatted to follow
longdesc generally accepted script style[1] while also maintaining a
longdesc high level of typographic integrity, and includes commands for
longdesc dialog, lyrics, stage directions, music and dance cues,
longdesc rehearsal marks, and more. It gracefully handles dialog that
longdesc crosses page breaks, and can generate lists of songs and lists
longdesc of dances in the show. [1] There are lots of references for the
longdesc One True Way to format a script. Naturally, none of them agree.
